(window.LP_CLIPS=window.LP_CLIPS||{});window.LP_CLIPS["en"]=Object.assign(window.LP_CLIPS["en"]||{},{"pip and the safe crossing": "", "pip the raccoon woke up in a little town, and the morning was bright.": "", "pip wanted to see the dog, who was waiting on the other side of the road.": "", "but the road was loud, the cars were fast, and pip, cat and duck were far too small to cross.": "", "pip sat and thought. people built this road, so people can change it.": "", "so pip knocked on doors, and the neighbours came out to listen.": "", "together they asked for a safe place to cross, and the town said yes.": "", "the diggers came, the roller rolled, and the workers painted bright stripes.": "", "now the cars stop, and everyone crosses together.": "", "pip hugged the dog. one small voice and a few good friends had changed the street.": "", "the world is made by people, and people can make it kinder. goodnight, pip. goodnight, everyone.": ""});
